Wrote 2 records to SSB+1-of-2.csv
Wrote 2 records to SSB+2-of-2.csv
-- expectedstderrcount --
Wrote 1 records to 10M+1-of-2.csv
Wrote 1 records to 10M+2-of-2.csv
Wrote 1 records to 12M+1-of-2.csv
Wrote 0 records to 12M+2-of-2.csv
Wrote 1 records to 15M+1-of-2.csv
Wrote 0 records to 15M+2-of-2.csv
