Wrote 1 records to 30M+1-of-2.csv
Wrote 0 records to 30M+2-of-2.csv
Wrote 1 records to 40M+1-of-2.csv
Wrote 0 records to 40M+2-of-2.csv
Wrote 1 records to 80M+1-of-2.csv
Wrote 0 records to 80M+2-of-2.csv
